# Topic repos: the drop folder (raw, unredacted input), kit state and the built viewer stay local. The rules match at
# any depth, so a topic made with `onto init --path <folder>` below the git root is covered too. A rule with a slash
# inside matches from the root only, hence the second viewer rule.
inbox/
.onto/
build/index.html
**/build/index.html
# The template's own demo notes are kit files and stay tracked.
!/examples/*/inbox/
# A local-scope plugin install ("for you, in this repo only") writes this file; it is per person and per machine.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
# Devin's local overrides (.devin/config.local.json and the like) are per person and per machine too.
**/.devin/*.local.json
# Python and OS junk, and Finder copies such as "notes 2.md"
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
* [0-9].*
